<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hankook Tire Mfg 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Hankook Tire Mfg 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     1,771 vs 2,187</p>
<p>    Net					     10.17 vs 10.06</p>
<p>    Turnover				   1,020.02 vs 877.38</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   15.19 vs  15.98</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>     common shares		  cash	   14 vs 14</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		     1.55 (loss) vs 0.66 (loss)</p>
<p>    Div Register					Dec 31</p>
<p>    Div Payment					 Mar 26</p>
<p>NOTE - Hankook Tire Manufacturing Co Ltd's share capital rose 1.16 million to 5.76 million in 1996 due to rights and bonus offerings.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5649</p>
</text>
